<b>Huh?</b>

04:52.331 --> 04:55.081
<b>You sure you don't want to run away?</b>

05:00.881 --> 05:04.171
<b>I bet you're a newly employed 
businessman who's already {grown }jaded{tired of work}.</b>

05:04.171 --> 05:07.761
<b>I ate too much crab and transformed into this!</b>

05:07.761 --> 05:11.221
<b>Why aren't you running from the mighty Crablante?</b>

05:12.931 --> 05:14.931
<b>Do you want to die?{You've got a death wish.}</b>

05:14.931 --> 05:16.891
<b>Is that it?</b>

05:16.891 --> 05:18.561
<b>Well, not quite.</b>

05:19.941 --> 05:22.441
<b>I'm no businessman. I'm unemployed.</b>

05:23.031 --> 05:25.281
<b>Right now, I'm looking for a job.</b>

05:26.281 --> 05:29.571
<b>I had another interview today and got royally rejected.</b>

05:30.451 --> 05:32.541
<b>I couldn't care less about anything.</b>

05:33.581 --> 05:38.331
<b>So I'm in no mood to run just because 
"the mighty Crablante" has appeared.</b>

05:41.541 --> 05:44.171
<b>So, what happens if I don't run?</b>

05:46.921 --> 05:49.761
<b>Your eyes are lifeless, just like mine.</b>

05:49.761 --> 05:54.221
<b>From one set of lifeless eyes to another, I'll let you go.</b>

05:54.221 --> 05:56.061
<b>Besides, right now…</b>

05:56.061 --> 05:58.481
<b>I'm hunting different prey.</b>

05:59.901 --> 06:01.311
<b>A big-chinned brat.</b>

06:02.151 --> 06:04.821
<b>And when I find him, 
I'm gonna {rip his arms off}tear him apart!</b>

06:19.461 --> 06:20.631
<b>What're you looking at?</b>

06:21.171 --> 06:23.091
<b><i>A big-chinned brat…</i></b>

06:23.091 --> 06:24.631
<b><i>If he gets caught, he's dead!</i></b>

06:25.591 --> 06:26.921
<b>Hey, kid.</b>

06:26.921 --> 06:29.341
<b>Were you messing with a big crab monster?</b>

06:29.341 --> 06:29.881
<b>Huh?</b>

06:31.141 --> 06:34.391
<b>He was asleep in the park, so I drew some nipples on him with my marker.</b>

06:35.641 --> 06:36.971
<b><i>It's definitely him!</i></b>

06:37.601 --> 06:40.651
<b><i>He has no idea what he's done.</i></b>

06:40.651 --> 06:42.521
<b><i>What do I do? I could still help!</i></b>

06:44.321 --> 06:46.481
<b><i>But man, this kid's pretty ugly{isn't cute at all}…</i></b>

06:47.031 --> 06:48.531
<b><i>It's none of my business.</i></b>

06:49.321 --> 06:50.611
<b><i>I should just walk away.</i></b>

06:51.821 --> 06:55.031
<b><i>Right. I mean, {who really cares}why should I care?</i></b>

06:56.741 --> 06:59.831
<b>There you are!{Found you!}{literal meaning vs. flow (and syllables)}</b>

07:02.331 --> 07:04.211
<b><i>What the hell am I doing?</i></b>

07:06.961 --> 07:08.921
<b>Kid, he's after <i>you</i> !</b>

07:08.921 --> 07:10.011
<b>Hurry up and run!</b>

07:12.431 --> 07:14.891
<b>Don't worry about me. Just go!</b>

07:15.471 --> 07:16.971
<b>B-But…</b>

07:17.771 --> 07:19.481
<b>My soccer ball…</b>

07:19.481 --> 07:20.311
<b>Your ball?!</b>

07:22.731 --> 07:25.821
<b>Hey, what do you think you're doing?{Hey, what's the big idea?}</b>

07:25.821 --> 07:28.781
<b>Don't tell me you're gonna 
protect that stinkin' brat!</b>

07:29.191 --> 07:33.611
<b>Come on, you're gonna kill him 
over some harmless prank?</b>

07:33.611 --> 07:35.531
<b>Think about this!{this line is questionable but it'll do}</b>

07:36.531 --> 07:39.121
<b>I've already mutilated tons of people.</b>

07:39.121 --> 07:43.501
<b>Anyone who mocks my appearance 
pays the price. No exceptions.</b>

07:45.041 --> 07:47.291
<b>And that brat…</b>

07:47.291 --> 07:50.551
<b>drew nipples on my body!</b>

07:50.551 --> 07:51.631
<b>With {a }permanent marker!{following in chihiro's footsteps and letting it go over the keyframe}{wow this is REALLY a struggle for nice timing vs nice cps}{there}</b>

07:52.551 --> 07:55.301
<b>Look at these claws! 
I can't even use a towel to wipe it off!</b>

07:56.721 --> 08:01.641
<b>Get out of my way, or I'll make sure you never go job hunting again!</b>

08:12.951 --> 08:14.741
<b>I just realized.</b>

08:14.741 --> 08:17.741
<b>You look just like a villain 
from an anime I used to watch!</b>

08:27.041 --> 08:28.041
<b>Die.</b>

08:33.631 --> 08:35.261
<b>Hold it right there.</b>

08:35.261 --> 08:38.851
<b>In this age of declining birth rates, 
I can't just let you kill a kid.</b>

08:41.391 --> 08:42.431
<b>You know what?</b>

08:43.021 --> 08:46.311
<b>When I was a little boy, I wanted to be a hero.</b>

08:46.311 --> 08:48.521
<b>Not a businessman,</b>

08:48.521 --> 08:52.571
<b>but a hero who could send scum{rotten villains} 
like you flying with one punch.</b>

08:53.151 --> 08:54.781
<b>Screw looking for a job!</b>

08:55.861 --> 08:57.531
<b>Bring it on!</b>

08:57.531 --> 09:01.831
<b>Some hero you are!</b>

09:02.411 --> 09:04.461
<b>You're pathetic!</b>

09:05.121 --> 09:07.421
<b>You don't stand a chance against me.</b>

09:09.041 --> 09:10.131
<b>It's time{Time for you}…</b>

09:11.001 --> 09:12.631
<b>to die!</b>

09:36.861 --> 09:39.571
<b><i>Has it really been three years since then?</i></b>

09:44.411 --> 09:45.371
<b><i>After that day,</i></b>

09:46.211 --> 09:49.131
<b><i>I trained so hard I went bald.</i></b>

09:49.131 --> 09:51.211
<b><i>I've become so powerful, no one can beat me.</i></b>

09:51.791 --> 09:54.131
<b><i>I'm the hero I dreamed of becoming.</i></b>

09:55.301 --> 09:57.801
<b><i>So what's this feeling? 
What am I missing?</i></b>

09:59.721 --> 10:02.931
<b><i>Why does my heart feel so empty?</i></b>

10:03.641 --> 10:05.681
<b>482 yen, please.</b>

10:06.021 --> 10:06.641
<b>Okay.</b>

10:08.141 --> 10:09.771
<b>Oh, hang on.</b>

10:16.321 --> 10:17.821
<b>I have 82 yen.</b>

10:42.391 --> 10:43.261
<b>Incredible…</b>

10:44.011 --> 10:46.221
<b>This is incredible, little brother!</b>

10:47.101 --> 10:49.561
<b>I never thought it would work so well.</b>

10:51.691 --> 10:52.611
<b><i>Yes,</i></b>

10:53.151 --> 10:55.941
<b><i>it's more than I'd ever imagined, big brother.</i></b>

10:57.651 --> 11:00.861
<b><i>My goal was to become stronger than any other man in the world.</i></b>

11:02.571 --> 11:03.911
<b><i>The strongest man.</i></b>

11:04.661 --> 11:06.491
<b><i>That was my dream.</i></b>

11:08.911 --> 11:13.211
<b>At last, the ultimate steroid, Biceps King, is complete!</b>

11:15.001 --> 11:16.501
<b>Little brother!</b>

11:16.501 --> 11:19.511
<b>Drink this and you will obtain 
the power you've been seeking!</b>

11:20.671 --> 11:23.471
<b>What? Drink that?</b>

11:23.471 --> 11:27.641
<b>Indeed! I added strawberry flavoring 
to make it go down easier.</b>

11:28.351 --> 11:29.521
<b>Brother…</b>

11:34.191 --> 11:34.811
<b>Yes,</b>

11:35.941 --> 11:38.361
<b>th-this will do!</b>

11:39.691 --> 11:42.071
<b>My brains and your brawn!</b>

11:42.071 --> 11:45.531
<b>By combining the brightest of minds 
and the strongest of bodies,</b>

11:45.531 --> 11:51.291
<b>we brothers will conquer the 
entire{everything on} world{earth} and rule as kings!</b>

11:58.711 --> 12:00.301
<b>I-Incredible!</b>

12:00.921 --> 12:02.421
<b>Well done, little brother.</b>

12:02.421 --> 12:04.051
<b>Thousands have perished!</b>

12:04.051 --> 12:07.301
<b>Now, on to the next town to destroy it as well!</b>

12:08.351 --> 12:11.431
<b>This is it, big bro.</b>

12:11.431 --> 12:13.641
<b>This is what I was looking for.</b>

12:13.641 --> 12:15.811
<b>The power to be the strongest.{alt: This is what I always dreamed of. / I am the strongest man.}</b>

12:16.191 --> 12:19.691
<b><i>This is an emergency evacuation warning.</i></b>

12:19.691 --> 12:24.321
<b><i>A giant creature has appeared in City D.</i></b>

12:24.321 --> 12:28.741
<b><i>The creature is currently heading towards City B.</i></b>

12:28.741 --> 12:33.001
<b><i>All residents of the area, 
please evacuate immediately.</i></b>

12:33.001 --> 12:36.131
<b><i>I repeat, the giant creature is currently heading for…</i></b>

12:37.001 --> 12:39.551
<b>Yes, that's right! Scatter like rats!</b>

12:39.551 --> 12:40.961
<b>Get them!</b>

12:40.961 --> 12:43.131
<b>I'm the strongest man,</b>

12:43.131 --> 12:46.471
<b>I'm the strongest man. I'm the strongest man.</b>

12:46.761 --> 12:49.141
<b>What do you think, brother?</b>

12:49.141 --> 12:51.561
<b>Yeah, how's it feel being the strongest?</b>

12:51.561 --> 12:51.891
<b>What?!</b>

12:52.351 --> 12:53.851
<b>There's someone up here{on your shoulder}!</b>

12:54.851 --> 12:56.101
<b>Put some pants on.</b>

12:57.651 --> 12:59.361
<b>The guy on your shoulder! Kill him!</b>

13:09.491 --> 13:12.581
<b>Brother!{lmao}</b>

13:13.501 --> 13:15.081
<b>How did this happen?!</b>

13:15.831 --> 13:19.421
<b>All I ever wanted was to be strong!</b>

13:19.421 --> 13:22.171
<b>And just when I finally became the strongest…{And I finally am the strongest man, but…!}</b>

13:26.881 --> 13:31.471
<b>I don't know who you are, 
but it's your fault my brother is dead!</b>

13:41.521 --> 13:42.781
<b><i>The strongest!</i></b>

13:43.231 --> 13:47.401
<b>Behold our brotherly power!</b>

14:01.041 --> 14:02.501
<b>I am the strongest.</b>

14:11.511 --> 14:13.221
<b>But so what?{So what if I am?}</b>

14:14.351 --> 14:15.601
<b>I feel empty.</b>

14:16.561 --> 14:17.561
<b>Right?</b>

14:27.991 --> 14:30.361
<b>Having overwhelming strength is…</b>

14:30.861 --> 14:32.571
<b>pretty boring.</b>

14:35.491 --> 14:36.121
<b>Whoops.</b>

14:36.871 --> 14:39.791
<b>CITY B DESTROYED</b>

14:56.181 --> 14:59.181
<b><i>There's no sign that the evils 
of the world are disappearing.</i></b>

14:59.771 --> 15:03.641
<b><i>It's the same as before I became a hero.</i></b>

15:03.641 --> 15:07.561
<b><i>In other words, you could say 
I haven't made an impact.</i></b>

15:08.271 --> 15:10.731
<b><i>{I'm not particularly sad about that}That doesn't really bother me, though.</i></b>

15:12.361 --> 15:15.451
<b><i>But something's been on my mind{bothering me} lately.</i></b>

15:16.451 --> 15:19.081
<b><i>As the days pass, my emotions grow more distant.</i></b>

15:20.081 --> 15:24.581
<b><i>Fear, tension, joy, anger… 
I hardly{barely} feel anything anymore.</i></b>

15:25.091 --> 15:26.891
<b><i>In exchange for power,</i></b>

15:26.891 --> 15:30.101
<b><i>have I lost some essential 
part of my humanity?{have I rejected my humanity? jojo?}</i></b>

15:35.551 --> 15:37.181
<b>Vroom, vroom?</b>

15:38.511 --> 15:40.851
<b>No sense hiding if you saw me.</b>

15:41.181 --> 15:44.811
<b>I'm Super Custom YO649Z Mk. II!</b>

15:45.191 --> 15:49.691
<b>I love building custom cars so much{bg}</b>

15:46.441 --> 15:50.771
<b><i>I used to feel all kinds of emotions 
whirling inside me when I fought.</i></b>

15:49.691 --> 15:51.531
<b>I decided to deck myself out.{bg}</b>

15:50.771 --> 15:53.611
<b><i>Fear, panic, anger.</i></b>

15:51.531 --> 15:53.611
<b>I'm a custom car-loving monster!{bg}</b>

15:53.611 --> 15:55.991
<b>If you're thinking of getting in my way,</b>

15:55.991 --> 15:59.371
<b>I'll put a shine on that big headlight of yours!</b>

16:05.161 --> 16:08.381
<b><i>But now, all I need is one punch to end it.</i></b>

16:11.881 --> 16:14.051
<b>Guess I'll have eggs over rice tonight.</b>

16:19.051 --> 16:23.141
<b><i>Every day, I come home uninjured{unharmed} and wash my gloves.</i></b>

16:24.141 --> 16:26.891
<b><i>When I'm out fighting monsters,</i></b>

16:26.891 --> 16:29.441
<b><i>it never feels like{I never feel as if} my heart's really in it.</i></b>

16:31.151 --> 16:34.781
<b><i>I mean, I just do the hero thing as a hobby.</i></b>

16:35.321 --> 16:36.071
<b><i>In other words,</i></b>

16:36.821 --> 16:38.531
<b><i>as long as I get a kick out of it,</i></b>

16:39.111 --> 16:40.451
<b><i>that's all I care about.</i></b>

17:02.471 --> 17:03.561
<b>My house!{I believe it's an apartment or a loft or something but whatever}</b>

17:17.941 --> 17:19.621
<b><i>He's tough!</i></b>

17:20.411 --> 17:22.371
<b>What the hell are you?</b>

17:22.871 --> 17:25.291
<b>"What" am I? How rude.</b>

17:25.291 --> 17:27.371
<b>We are the true Earthlings.</b>

17:27.951 --> 17:29.411
<b>"We"?</b>

17:29.411 --> 17:33.001
<b>I believe you call us "Subterraneans."</b>

17:34.041 --> 17:35.841
<b>We suffer from overpopulation.</b>

17:36.671 --> 17:39.841
<b>Therefore, we must now 
colonize the surface world.</b>

17:40.881 --> 17:44.011
<b>I understand that there are 
many people on the surface too.</b>

17:44.011 --> 17:46.441
<b>As it stands, you are in our way.</b>

17:47.101 --> 17:48.941
<b>That is why we have decided</b>

17:48.941 --> 17:51.941
<b>to return you all to the earth{eradicate you all}.</b>

17:52.981 --> 17:59.151
<b>Since the start of our invasion, 
we have killed 70% of you surface dwellers.</b>

17:59.151 --> 18:01.111
<b>This is a battle for survival.</b>

18:01.111 --> 18:03.661
<b>I hope you can understand that.</b>

18:04.911 --> 18:07.621
<b>However, this is a surprise{unexpected}.</b>

18:07.621 --> 18:10.791
<b>We have never met a surface dweller 
who could survive our punches.</b>

18:10.791 --> 18:13.171
<b>Same here.</b>

18:13.171 --> 18:16.341
<b>It's been too long since I last 
met a worthy opponent,</b>

18:16.841 --> 18:18.171
<b>Subterraneans!</b>

18:20.381 --> 18:22.141
<b>We are Earthlings!</b>

18:30.521 --> 18:32.151
<b>H-How?!</b>

18:33.021 --> 18:34.521
<b>You bastard!</b>

18:38.281 --> 18:39.781
<b>Die!</b>

19:31.541 --> 19:32.951
<b>It's over.</b>

19:34.331 --> 19:38.081
<b>{What}Who on earth <i>was</i> that surface dweller?</b>

19:38.081 --> 19:39.421
<b>I'm…</b>

19:40.001 --> 19:43.301
<b>just a guy who's a hero for fun.</b>

19:43.761 --> 19:46.051
<b>I will not lose.</b>

19:46.511 --> 19:47.681
<b>And the surface…</b>

19:48.601 --> 19:50.221
<b>is under my protection!</b>

19:52.021 --> 19:54.231
<b>Big talk for a race of vermin!</b>

20:09.241 --> 20:12.331
<b><i>What is this feeling?</i></b>

20:13.331 --> 20:14.831
<b><i>This pounding in my chest?{!}</i></b>

20:18.211 --> 20:21.591
<b><i>This rush! This tension!</i></b>

20:28.431 --> 20:30.681
<b><i>It's been so long,{ that} I've forgotten{I forgot}</i></b>

20:31.971 --> 20:35.931
<b><i>the exhilaration of a real fight!</i></b>

20:50.031 --> 20:52.781
<b><i>It's coming back to me.</i></b>

20:53.621 --> 20:54.491
<b><i>This is it!</i></b>

20:54.491 --> 20:56.041
<b>Well, well…</b>

20:56.881 --> 21:02.041
<b>Looks like you've been taking good care of my children.</b>

21:02.041 --> 21:03.171
<b><i>This is it!</i></b>

21:03.551 --> 21:06.931
<b>I, the Subterranean King, will take you on.</b>

21:08.641 --> 21:10.181
